MangaDenizi native Kitsugi extension

Public API adapter and Android image reconstruction for Kitsugi MangaSource.
The tiled-v1 interoperability work references the MangaDenizi adapter and
UnscramblerInterceptor in Keiyoushi extensions-source (Apache License 2.0),
retained under keiyoushi-extensions-tr/src/tr/mangadenizi in this repository.

Only this extension's own code is packaged. Host API classes, Kotlin runtime,
OkHttp, coroutines, Jsoup and copyrighted chapter images are not bundled.
